  m_BadgeTitle: "\u25C6 SCENARIO 1 BRIEFING"
  m_DialogueLines:
  - Introduction to Scenario 1...
  - You have just arrived at your corporate office workstation and begun reviewing
    your morning tasks.
  - Everything seems normal until you notice a Telegram message from your coworker
    Sovann.
  - He needs you to check your email and compare salary slips for August, providing
    a password and an attached archive file to open.
  - The message was sent a few moments ago, and your routine is about to be interrupted.
